<string name="cable_local_types_title">Indonesian Cable Types (Reference)</string>
<string name="cable_types_body">• NYA: Single-core Cu PVC wire for fixed indoor conduit.\n• NYM: Multicore Cu white PVC cable for indoor walls/trays.\n• NYY: Multicore Cu black PVC cable for indoor/outdoor/duct.\n• NYFGbY: Steel-armoured Cu PVC cable for direct burial.\n• NYAF: Flexible fine-stranded Cu PVC wire for panel wiring.</string>
<string name="cable_source_note" formatted="false">DC &amp; 1P ΔV = 2·I·L·(R cos φ + X sin φ) (DC: cos φ = 1), 3P ΔV = √3·I·L·(R cos φ + X sin φ), X = 0.08 Ω/km. Default 3%/5% limits &amp; IEC 60364-5-52 Annex G ρ: PERLU CEK MANUAL against SNI 0225:2020.</string>
