<string name="motor_out_kdelta">Delta contactor KΔ (AC-3)</string>
<string name="motor_out_kstar">Star contactor KY (AC-3)</string>
<string name="motor_out_tor">Overload relay (TOR)</string>
<string name="motor_out_breaker">Breaker range (MCB/MCCB/MPCB)</string>
<string name="motor_std_nearest">std ≥ %1$d A</string>
<string name="motor_std_exceeds">&gt; 630 A</string>
<string name="motor_curve_note">Use MPCB (set to In), MCB Curve D/K (10..20× In), or motor MCCB. Star-Delta: place TOR in phase branch (set ≈ 0.58× In).</string>
<string name="motor_source_note" formatted="false">In = P/(√3·V·cos φ·η); 1 HP = 745.7 W. Star-Delta: KM &amp; KΔ ≈ 0.58·In, KY ≈ 0.33·In, phase TOR ≈ 0.58·In, Y start ≈ 1/3 DOL. Standard ratings: PERLU CEK MANUAL (IEC 60947-4-1).</string>
<string name="cap_title">Capacitor Bank (Power Factor Correction)</string>
<string name="cap_hint">Enter P (kW), V, initial cos φ1, and target cos φ2 to compute required kVAR, current reduction, and 5/6/8 steps.</string>
