<string name="cap_cosphi2_label">Target cos φ2 (0..1)</string>
<string name="cap_out_q">Required bank Q</string>
<string name="cap_out_i_saved">Current reduction ΔI</string>
<string name="cap_steps_title">Regulator Steps (5 / 6 / 8 Steps)</string>
<string name="cap_step_row" formatted="false">%1$d steps: ideal %2$s | std %3$s kVAR × %1$d = %4$s kVAR (%5$s A/step)</string>
<string name="cap_source_note" formatted="false">Q = P·(tan φ1 − tan φ2) kVAR; ΔI% = (1 − cos φ1/cos φ2)×100%. Step sizes (2.5..100 kVAR): PERLU CEK MANUAL for harmonics/reactors.</string>
